WEBVTT - Navigation & Wayfinding (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:08.191
In a deep page tree, visitors get lost when menus and breadcrumbs disagree.

2
00:00:09.291 --> 00:00:16.095
Navigation and Wayfinding has 24 elements for menus, headers and paths through a site.

3
00:00:17.295 --> 00:00:23.864
Dropdown menus, breadcrumbs, maps, profile headers, a search header and tabs.

4
00:00:25.064 --> 00:00:29.439
Every element uses the same design tokens as the rest of the site.
